Z||000000||Galen||05-13-2001||11:40 AM||||I have a 3.8 out of a 82 olds cutless. How hard would it be to put in my 88? what would I need and so forth. ?? basicly any informtion that I dont feel like searching for would be nice.. thnx  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Galen - 1988 Hawaiian Orchid Coupe Auto 4Banger - <A HREF="http://myfiero.spinrpg.com/" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero Website</A><BR>AIM: WookieeNC||||reg||5
Z||000001||Pontiaddict||05-13-2001||04:12 PM||||I'm guessing it's rear wheel drive, you'd be better off finding a FWD engine. It's possoble to use the RWD motor, but it's not like 3.8's are rare or anything and it isn't worth doing. (unless it's a turbo motor, which your's is not) ||||reg||1
